## Type

- Body: the system font stack. Display: the same until a typeface is chosen for this product.
- Scale: `--step--1` … `--step-3`; line length at most `--measure`.

## Layout and principles

- One column up to `--page`; works from 390 px wide.
- One memorable element; everything else quiet.
- Sentence case, plain verbs; a button says what happens ("Save changes").

